Cell["\<\
The slab {\[Minus]1, 1} at distance 5 on the grid, the two layers on either \
side of the missing bisector:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"5165885b-acfb-45a4-ab47-56d987d3d4da"],

